00:31:48,600 --> 00:31:52,110
Vais pagar por isto,

626
00:31:52,110 --> 00:31:52,610
CHARLOTTE LINLIN
BIG MOM, A YONKOU

627
00:31:52,610 --> 00:31:55,280
Chapéu de Palha!
CHARLOTTE LINLIN
BIG MOM, A YONKOU

628
00:31:57,320 --> 00:31:57,870
Imperador?

629
00:31:57,870 --> 00:31:59,160
Imperador?
MARSHALL D. TEACH
BARBA NEGRA, O YONKOU

630
00:31:59,160 --> 00:32:01,910
Ainda é cedo demais para ti...
MARSHALL D. TEACH
BARBA NEGRA, O YONKOU

